{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kick and Hide is a hectic multiplayer experience based on the classic children's yard game kick the can. Bring your friends, it's pretty boring alone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A single game consists of 5 rounds, where each round one person is selected as the seeker, and the rest are hiders. In the middle of the map is a ball. The seeker's job is to keep it there, the hiders have to kick it away and hide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a hider, you win by not getting caught by the seeker or by rescuing other hiders. If you get caught, yell help and hope that another hider frees you by kicking the ball away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the seeker, you must catch all the hiders. You can catch a hider by detecting them and then running back to the ball. However, you can only do so when the ball is in its designated spot, and the hiders reeeallly like to kick it away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Always keep one eye on the ball, and the other looking for them pesky hiders.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3698510?t=1746533585","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/57003e2b4b92c81d28d86c6b1564f9c581292847/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746533585","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/7d6c47a4134bfd37cfa2d008c24848b3669da2c7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746533585","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/7d6c47a4134bfd37cfa2d008c24848b3669da2c7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746533585","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kick and Hide is a hectic multiplayer experience based on the classic children's yard game kick the can. Bring your friends, it's pretty boring alone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A single game consists of 5 rounds, where each round one person is selected as the seeker, and the rest are hiders. In the middle of the map is a ball. The seeker's job is to keep it there, the hiders have to kick it away and hide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a hider, you win by not getting caught by the seeker or by rescuing other hiders. If you get caught, yell help and hope that another hider frees you by kicking the ball away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the seeker, you must catch all the hiders. You can catch a hider by detecting them and then running back to the ball. However, you can only do so when the ball is in its designated spot, and the hiders reeeallly like to kick it away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Always keep one eye on the ball, and the other looking for them pesky hiders.</p>","developers":["Stolen Heater"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698510/b9f9e55dde81406a946257b5d8823e5fa1cfdc0c/header.jpg?t=1746533585","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257132743,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132743/movie480.mp4?t=1746169597","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132743/movie_max.mp4?t=1746169597"},"name":"Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257132743/4c72f47faadc92650b3234fbb659680512db2060/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746169597","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132743/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746169597","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132743/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746169597"}}],"name":"Kick and Hide","package_groups":[],"pc_r